SUMMARY:Highlands Mountaintop Art & Craft Show
DESCRIPTION:Men in Harmony\nThe festival happening in Highlands\, NC on Su
 nday\, August 30\, 2026\, is the Mountaintop Art and Craft Show\, featurin
 g regional fine art\, local food\, and live music.\n**Event Schedule & Det
 ails**\n\nSunday\, Aug 30\, Highlands\, NC. **Arrive at 10 am at the Mount
 ain Fresh Grocery Store\, 521 Main St\, Highlands\, NC**\, 28741.. (across
  from the Episcopal church). Park where you can and walk. We'll perform fr
 om 11 am-noon at the Kelsey Hutchinson Park.\n\n* **Location:** [Kelsey-Hu
 tchinson Founders Park](https://www.highlandschamber.org/mountaintop-arts-
 craft-show/) on 411-499 Pine Street\, Highlands\, NC 28741\n* **Representi
 ng the Macon County Arts Council**\n\n**Admission:** Free and family-frien
 dly\n-10am meet\, Sing 11-12- **PAID EVENT**
